@title Cooling selection: a proposed fan gets a small slow fan icon (still under the harness)
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Same hot cabinet and Quick run as scenario 110. When a fan or filter fan is proposed a 16 pt fan icon sits before the sentence. It turns slowly in the live app (run with KOPERCAD_MOTION=1: the two pictures differ) and is a fixed frame under the harness and with Reduce motion.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooling-advice.novo
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
click_text "Settings for the next run"
wait 10
click_text Quick
wait 10
click_text Simulate #2
wait_s 200
expect_not "Preliminary"
move 700 650
wait 10
click_text "Cooling selection"
wait 10
shot fan-a
expect "Cooling selection proposes"
wait 30
shot fan-b
check_layout
